@nsobid-41EAE379C103E9A512CFA931BA400E938B3B7C55

# Captain Toad Treasure Tracker 1.4.2 - Disable FXAA

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

// Disables FXAA on the agl::pfx::FilterAA post effect.
//
// al::ViewRenderer::drawView runs FilterAA once per frame when the
// StressParam AntiAliasingType selects it. agl::pfx::FilterAA::draw_
// dispatches on antialias_type (0 FXAA, 1 ReduceAA, 2 SMAA, 3 callback)
// and falls back to a plain ImageFilter2D::drawTexture copy when the
// filter is off. The FXAA case now branches to that copy, so the frame is
// passed through unfiltered while the other modes are left untouched.

@enabled
006297C8 06000014   // B +0x18 to the pass-through copy (was MOV X0,X21 = FXAA case)
@stop

// Offsets reverse-engineered against Captain Toad Treasure Tracker 1.4.2
// (al + agl + sead, NVN). The retail build keeps its symbol table; every
// site was located by symbol and byte-verified against the IDB before
// being written.
//
// https://github.com/RAMDRAGONS/switch-patches
